SUMMARY:20s & 30s Earth Day After Work Hike at Mt. Pisgah
LOCATION:120 Linden S\nBerlin\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, April 22\, 2026\nhttps://activities.outdoors.org/s
 /oc-activity/a5UVX00000169jB2AQ/\nCelebrate Earth Day with an after work h
 ike at Mount Pisgah! We'll be going at a moderate to fast pace to get in a
  good workout. The trails traverse undulating terrain with a few steep sec
 tions. Distance: around 4 miles. Elevation gain: ~500 feet. Expect to be 
 on the trail for a couple of hours. We'll aim to finish before dark. Exact
  start time and location will be sent to registered participants. We'll be
  looping on trails around the 715-foot Mount Pisgah. The forest is varied 
 with white pines\, beech\, white oak\, maple\, and hop hornbeam. It is als
 o the home to several species of songbirds\, wild turkeys\, and owls.In th
 e spirit of Earth Day\, we'll bring trash bags to clean up the trailhead a
 nd any litter we come across on the trail.
END:VEVENT
