SUMMARY:20's & 30's Interchapter Spring Fling: Hike at Leadmine Mountain C
 onservation Area
LOCATION:Old Sturbridge Village Road\nSturbridge\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, April 25\, 2026 | 11:00 AM\nhttps://activities.outd
 oors.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX00000157jR2AQ/\nJoin us for an exploration of 
 Leadmine Mountain Conservation Area in Sturbridge\, MA! Our route will tak
 e us on an ~6 mile loop featuring a variety of scenery\, from woodlands to
  ponds to perhaps some wildlife. This will have a little under 600ft eleva
 tion gain\, and we will aim for a pace of ~1.5mph. We will plan to take a 
 ~15-20 minute break at somepoint along the route for a lunch/ long-snack.D
 epending on the size of the group we have\, we will likley split into two 
 groups\, each with two leaders. Each group will go in a different directio
 n of the loop. Groups will be assigned based on the timing of when you sig
 n up.This event is part of the 20's & 30's Interchapter Spring Fling with 
 the Connecticut\, Narragansett\, Southeastern MA\, Western MA\, and Worces
 ter chapters. After the hike\, participants are encouraged to attend the S
 ocial at Tree House Brewing Co starting at 4pm. Details and registration f
 or that part of the event can be found here: 20's & 30's Interchapter Spri
 ng Fling 2026: Social at Tree House Brewing Company in Charlton\, MA
END:VEVENT
