SUMMARY:20's & 30's Hike at the Cascades (Worcester)
LOCATION:Worcester\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, April 26\, 2026 | 9:45 AM\nhttps://activities.outdoor
 s.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX0000015hAD2AY/\nJoin the Worcester Chapter 20s & 
 30s for an easy to moderate hike at the scenic Cascades in Worcester! We w
 ill hike a loop of about 4 miles at a moderate pace over rolling terrain\,
  starting at the beautiful Cascades waterfall. Please wear sturdy shoes w
 ith laces\; bring at least 1.5 liters of water\, trail snacks\, and approp
 riate layers of clothing\, and a day pack to carry your gear.Details about
  time and meeting location will be sent to registered participants. If you
  have any questions\, please email the leader.
END:VEVENT
