SUMMARY:Worcester 20s/30s After Work Hike: Tetassest Ridge
LOCATION:God's Acre\, Swan Av\nWorcester\, MA 01603
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, May 4\, 2026\nhttps://activities.outdoors.org/s/oc-ac
 tivity/a5UVX0000015e132AA/\nJoin us for an after work hike to Tetasset Rid
 ge/Gods Acre on the west side of Worcester. We will hike ~3-4 miles with a
  total elevation gain of about 400 ft-- we'll stop for a view over the cit
 y and to see a historical marker. The trails will include sections of mode
 rate terrain and we will be moving at a moderate pace.Proper equipment wil
 l be required for this hike\, including: hiking and weather appropriate cl
 othing\, water\, and a headlamp.You'll be asked to fill out a screening fo
 rm upon registration for the hike. 
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a5UVX00000152yH2AQ
SEQUENCE:0
